  "worked_solution": "Let's examine our statement:\n\n- The word \"all\" indicates we should use a universal quantifier, $\u2200.$\n\n- The sentence refers to integer numbers. So, by denoting an integer as $a,$ we have that \n\n$$\n\u2200\\,a\\in Z.\n$$\n\n- Finally, the condition in the statement can be written as \n\n$$\na\\in Q.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we write the statement as follows: \n\n$\u2200\\,a\\in Z,\\,a\\in Q.$",
